  {
   "section": 13,
   "marker": "*13 SECTION - End of game                     ********************************",
   "lines": [
    {
     "raw": "]@[",
     "command": "@"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 009[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]A[",
     "command": "A"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 907[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Your ship streams from the incandescent glow of the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "explosions you have just created in the midst of the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Microsol fleet, and hunts down the final escape pod"
    },
    {
     "raw": "from the mother ship just as it punches into hyperspace. "
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "It is finally over. The people of Deliani are saved,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and you have stopped a galaxy wide catastrophe."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]C[",
     "command": "C"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 907[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "\"Congratulations!\" shouts Transon Lohk over the comm"
    },
    {
     "raw": "screen. \"Our forces were ready to defend the city"
    },
    {
     "raw": "after your last transmission, but thanks to you we"
    },
    {
     "raw": "haven't even suffered a scratch. I will make sure you"
    },
    {
     "raw": "are richly rewarded for this...\""
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]C[",
     "command": "C"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 907[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "You smile and flick off the comm, your mouth twisting"
    },
    {
     "raw": "into a frown. No reward could bring back your parents,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and your best friend. Though you have saved millions of"
    },
    {
     "raw": "lives, why did the people closest to you have to suffer?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Still, there's nothing you can do about it, and you vow"
    },
    {
     "raw": "to make sure that the same thing never happens again."
    },
    {
     "raw": "From now on Tyrian sector will be a name synonymous"
    },
    {
     "raw": "with peace..."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Q[",
     "command": "Q"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-1-1:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "BONUS ROUND"
    },
    {
     "raw": "There are two sections where a solid row of ships move"
    },
    {
     "raw": "down and wait.  The first purple ship that comes down"
    },
    {
     "raw": "each time has a power-up.  Others carry gems."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-1-2:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "CAMANIS"
    },
    {
     "raw": "In the section where enemies fly straight up behind you,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "there is a slow-moving enemy that has a power-up."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-1-3:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "SECRET LEVEL : SAWBLADES"
    },
    {
     "raw": "The spiders, while hard to reach, contain 10000 pts in"
    },
    {
     "raw": "gems."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-2-1:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "?SECRET LEVELS?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Two secret levels in Episode 3 are in the same place."
    },
    {
     "raw": "(Mull that one over.)"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-2-2:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "STARGATE"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Two of the flying spikes can be destroyed.  Each is"
    },
    {
     "raw": "worth 10000 pts."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-2-3:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "EPISODE 3"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Play at the hard difficulty level for an extra reward."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-3-1:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "EPISODE 3"
    },
    {
     "raw": "There are three secret levels you can access with the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "warp bubbles."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-3-2:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "GOD MODE"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Type a capital G, then type a SHIFT-RIGHT BRACKET."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Secret Hint 3-3-3:"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "INSANE DETAIL"
    },
    {
     "raw": "In the Setup program, type a W when you have detail"
    },
    {
     "raw": "level selected."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    }
   ]
  },
